[
  {
    "name": "Example Dashboard - V9.6.1",
    "description": "The v9 vendor episode with its calendars. Markets: two EODHD price histories, an income statement and a candlestick chart, sharing one symbol and one interval. Calendars: the EODHD economic calendar as a paged month, Treasury auctions as an endless week grid, and the EODHD earnings calendar as a horizontal day ribbon filtered to seven names, each with its stock logo — each a Calendar view over the table the backend already serves. Needs the OpenBB backend with the eodhd provider configured.",
    "img": "",
